Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.90,0:00:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want it, gotta go over the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm aiming to get there first, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all or nothing. No time to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.48,0:00:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it later, right now I'm living free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.56,0:00:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:00:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that to run is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're closed, they\Nfeel the satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm rude,\Nhere's my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.02,0:01:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When things are getting\Ntough, just gotta smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.42,0:01:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're looking for\Na fresh, brand new day?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make sure your only\Nthought you have is Yes, I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.34,0:01:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.14,0:01:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Marked maps will be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with every step that you will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at all you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead at new horizons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.22,0:01:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In view shining brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.06,0:01:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, who knows what's waiting for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Make like a hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.28,0:01:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, got to make your mark today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.26,0:01:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dreams don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You doubted the loyalty of my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.56,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,At times like these, we\Nhave to focus on the battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.76,0:02:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and trust each other completely?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.60,0:02:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,or we'll die out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.58,0:02:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I get why he was mad, but\Nhe didn't have to ditch us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.98,0:02:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope he comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.84,0:02:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Frickin' Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.98,0:02:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,She really screwed this one up for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.98,0:02:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't really blame her\Nfor acting that way, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.10,0:02:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido came in, took over her country,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,trashed it, and screwed up\Nher life in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been waiting 20 long years\Nfor this plan to come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.06,0:02:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I getcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But even if Law's crew did rent us\Nout, I couldn't blame them either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.22,0:02:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.13,0:02:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that's what you would do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.28,0:02:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.19,0:02:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd squeal in one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.02,0:02:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, if I was being tortured,\Nmore like three seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.94,0:03:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too short even\Nfor me! Piss off! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.14,0:03:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need help from lower-class scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.88,0:03:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when does anyone get\Nangry in Ebisu town anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be that hag\Nmonster's curse! God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.24,0:03:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be the new fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.18,0:03:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They arrived from the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.90,0:03:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard they were kicked out yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.36,0:03:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.98,0:03:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You little squirts better get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.36,0:03:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They were forced out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Only those who are loyal to the Shogun and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.00,0:03:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,can make profits are\Npermitted to live there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But from what I heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.84,0:03:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Those men were up to some bad business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.96,0:03:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and earned their banishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,See him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.80,0:03:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Buggy the underling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.94,0:03:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That one was into some\Nreal naughty business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.14,0:03:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He went around setting fires at night, but\Npaid off officials to avoid punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.82,0:04:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,An arsonist?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He paid bribes just to torment people?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It was more than just a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He was in cahoots with someone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,namely a lumber dealer who sold supplies?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,for rebuilding burned houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.18,0:04:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's bongo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.34,0:04:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.25,0:04:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not all. I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.68,0:04:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A third man, a priest and undertaker,\Nexploited the fire victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.06,0:04:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In their time of mourning, he\Ngouged them on funeral costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They were working together? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.24,0:04:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bingo, Bongo, and Bungo are our bad bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A band of bamboozlers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.84,0:04:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Scumbags.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.75,0:04:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who does that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.04,0:04:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, because they paid off the\Nofficials, they weren't arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.78,0:04:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They got away with everything without\Nso much as a slap on the wrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,On the outside, they\Nlooked like decent men,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.24,0:05:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but on the inside, they\Nwere rotten to the core.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the kicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.64,0:05:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All three of them were head over heels\Nin love with the beautiful Gomorrah Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.82,0:05:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the Oiran who met an\Nuntimely death just yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.60,0:05:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they all went\Nbankrupt trying to woo her,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,throwing all the money\Nthey owned at her feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.78,0:05:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So I suppose they got their\Njust desserts in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.68,0:05:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.72,0:05:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,At least the story ends well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.38,0:05:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.38,0:05:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Those rumors seem really specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.34,0:05:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure they must hold some weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.18,0:05:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And the way you tell it, I bet that\NOiran tricked them on purpose. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.40,0:05:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help but wonder\Nwhat she was really like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.28,0:05:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know them! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.68,0:05:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw them before!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.24,0:05:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They threw a fit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.68,0:05:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They were making a big scene\Nat the Oideron's procession!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.02,0:05:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasuie, bless his soul, was helping them\Npick out a house and showing them around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.66,0:05:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that those ungrateful\Nmiscreants appreciated it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.32,0:05:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.30,0:05:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What a guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.66,0:06:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He really is nice to everyone, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.98,0:06:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you recruited a slew of\Nnew people, so not always lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you please pass on a\Nmessage to my pal, Kinamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.84,0:06:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him that once the fight starts,\Nhe'll have us at his side, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.22,0:06:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He is your pal, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.20,0:06:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a pleasure\Nseeing the both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll excuse\Nme, we've got lots to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.18,0:06:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't leave yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.28,0:06:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Plenty of folks are likely\Nto die in the next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.68,0:06:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.59,0:06:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We have our work cut out\Nfor us and then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.10,0:06:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Alrighty, I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.88,0:06:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking sharp, handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.70,0:06:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You two beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.80,0:07:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You three have a wonderful\Nday now. Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.46,0:07:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that was weird. What's his deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.40,0:07:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He was running his mouth\Nlike you were good friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.86,0:07:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but I couldn't figure out\Nhow you were connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.16,0:07:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't tell either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.48,0:07:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I thought he was rather charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.14,0:07:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are the three of you close?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.68,0:07:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.10,0:07:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you don't know who he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.32,0:07:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you talk to him the\Nwhole time without asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.84,0:07:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He just drolled on and on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.78,0:07:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't get word in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.04,0:07:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you forget someone\Nlike that, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.36,0:07:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that he spoke to us\Nwith such familiarity puzzled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.62,0:07:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides that, what if he\Nindeed was a man of importance?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.46,0:07:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, I'd look a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.44,0:07:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Was he a childhood friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps a mentor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:08:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He seemed so comfortable\Nand happy in your presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.36,0:08:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.34,0:08:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How would we know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.62,0:08:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.74,0:08:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Make him pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.70,0:08:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on tight, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.56,0:08:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe I know what\Nyou mean by Haki now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.54,0:08:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Riyuo in the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.16,0:08:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Riyuo, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.20,0:08:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The term means flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.16,0:08:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're using Haki, you let it\Nrun through your body, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.20,0:08:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You must feel it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.26,0:09:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I just gotta let it flow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to pull back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.80,0:09:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I touched him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Messed it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're over-stressing yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.12,0:09:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow the Haki to move to your fist\Nfrom the parts that don't use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.50,0:09:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your time's up, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Still off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.26,0:09:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.24,0:09:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.42,0:10:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope! No! Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.42,0:10:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting sick of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.92,0:10:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My Haki won't flow the right way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He just keeps on taking them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't kill stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.38,0:10:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.66,0:10:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus your Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.14,0:10:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't flow into an angry fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.70,0:10:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna step up next?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.96,0:10:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.16,0:10:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you do, Pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.98,0:10:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How are those old stomach\Ncramps treating you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.54,0:10:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Yasuie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.84,0:10:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a lot, but I'm leaving\Nsome millet and water for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.48,0:10:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So make sure to eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.30,0:10:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a helpful fellow,\NYasuie. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.16,0:11:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, why, it was nothing, nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.28,0:11:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm delighted to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.74,0:11:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.65,0:11:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.57,0:11:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll even throw in another bag for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.52,0:11:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,See you, pups. Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.20,0:11:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.20,0:11:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have enough medicine,\Nseaweed shop, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.10,0:11:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.28,0:11:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But truth be told, seeing\Nyou always cheers me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.88,0:11:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.88,0:11:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You talk to everyone that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.28,0:11:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.94,0:11:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How's the knee holding up? Yes, Sue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.42,0:11:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.06,0:11:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you Huang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.54,0:11:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your mama feeling better?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.74,0:11:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Saki, how's the baby doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.52,0:11:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.24,0:11:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.74,0:11:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to say hi to us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not much, but take these.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.24,0:11:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.30,0:11:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, he's so generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.88,0:11:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he rich? Nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Spreading his wealth around town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.22,0:11:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite the contrary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.24,0:11:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor man works himself to\Nthe bone and gets paid peanuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.88,0:12:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a daughter, a girl named Dock, but\Nshe was sold into a job at the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.80,0:12:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She sends most of her\Nearnings back here to Yasuie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.06,0:12:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.06,0:12:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Dock, that's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.10,0:12:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.70,0:12:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Since so much of his\Nmoney is sent from Dock,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.82,0:12:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,he says it isn't right\Nto keep it for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.76,0:12:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So he goes around and spreads\Nit to those less fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.42,0:12:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A blessing for those\Nof us too weak to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.94,0:12:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He may come across as foolish, but\Nhe's a beloved member of our community?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.62,0:12:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,who supported us for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.44,0:12:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's our saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss you, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.66,0:12:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.18,0:13:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done for today. Go to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.30,0:13:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.30,0:13:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got plenty of fight left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.52,0:13:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do we gotta wait till tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.44,0:13:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.40,0:13:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you guys going to at least feed us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.26,0:13:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop yapping like a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.56,0:13:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.68,0:13:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to turn into\Na mummy by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.10,0:13:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask you something, Mr. Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.16,0:13:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so eager to fight Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.80,0:13:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you lost to him in Kuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't talk yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.10,0:14:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There, that'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.76,0:14:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.86,0:14:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.77,0:14:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the Four Emperors?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.78,0:14:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.98,0:14:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They're called that because they're\Nthe most powerful pirates out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.18,0:14:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,supposedly unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.70,0:14:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, one of those guys is Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.80,0:14:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be king of the pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.82,0:14:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,so that means I've got to\Ntake them all down to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.26,0:14:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirate king?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.98,0:14:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to become a gold roger?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.52,0:14:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you saying you\Nknow about him, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.88,0:14:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he visited the land of\NWano quite some time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.34,0:14:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That lines up with what Keenumont said.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.64,0:14:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.55,0:14:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.47,0:14:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.34,0:14:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is my hearing off?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:14:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.04,0:15:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be! Rizal?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.48,0:15:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.16,0:15:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.08,0:15:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.20,0:15:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think this is\Nthe real Raizo. It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you inside that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.54,0:15:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still alive, Raizo? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.60,0:15:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall explain all to you, Sir Hyogoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.38,0:15:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.66,0:15:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Uchimichu Koza!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.30,0:15:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're cornered now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.54,0:15:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.82,0:15:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it's really you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.76,0:15:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It is indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.02,0:15:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And I assure you, I am as surprised\Nby our meeting as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.90,0:16:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.46,0:16:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.90,0:16:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,does this mean that your\Ndesperate plan was successful
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.06,0:16:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and you really arrived here\Nfor 20 years in the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.02,0:16:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Lady Toki's sorcery. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.22,0:16:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What I don't get is why\Nyou're here, caribou.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.74,0:16:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.32,0:16:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't be like that, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.98,0:16:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're pals, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.54,0:16:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What gives here, Rhizo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.36,0:16:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you only came\Nhere to break me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you helping this Garp? Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.78,0:16:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to be such a Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.48,0:16:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I might come in handy after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.40,0:16:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your underling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.06,0:16:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me orders, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.68,0:16:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, in exchange for just one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.06,0:16:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,may I have a ride home\Non your ship with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.40,0:16:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tough luck, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.82,0:16:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're stranded here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.16,0:16:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've realized the error of my ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.26,0:16:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.17,0:16:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a changed man, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.80,0:17:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's a deal, but\Nonly because you changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.56,0:17:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.16,0:17:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That was way too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.52,0:17:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Luffy Taro, the groveling fellow\Nhas quite a remarkable skill set.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.68,0:17:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He shall be of great service to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.80,0:17:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,For so long, I thought my fate\Nwas sealed, but I didn't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.80,0:17:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I kept clinging on to this\Nwretched life, I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.70,0:17:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.61,0:17:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.50,0:17:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How close I came to letting\Nmyself die in this prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.04,0:17:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I had accepted death!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.10,0:18:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If this had happened a moment too late, I\Nmight have died, never knowing the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.82,0:18:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So the Akazaya Samurai\Nare still alive, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.30,0:18:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And that isn't all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin's son Kozuki Momonosuke too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.86,0:18:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more than some tall tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.86,0:18:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The rebel's flame still burns bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.70,0:18:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise off! And Mr. Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.74,0:18:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I may be old, but for my country's sake,\NI will always have fight left in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,May I join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.06,0:18:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be something I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.52,0:18:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be an honor to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.56,0:18:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,this man kneeling before you was once the\Ngreatest Yakuza boss in the land of Lardo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.54,0:18:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.45,0:19:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So you were a big deal\Nback in the day, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.74,0:19:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You mentioned that you've been gathering
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.76,0:19:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,supporters for the cause\Nin the Flower Capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.76,0:19:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.67,0:19:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.59,0:19:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it really must be fate that\Nbrought you here to Udon, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.48,0:19:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Located in this labor camp, there\Nare four other excavation sites?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,just as vast as this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.74,0:19:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention tens of thousands\Nof prisoners exactly like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.50,0:19:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the inmates here were\Nlocked up for petty theft or assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nearly every single one of\Nthem are guilty of rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.38,0:19:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Against Shogun? Orgy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.82,0:19:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did this not occur to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.98,0:19:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The rage of this country is\Nready to burst from these gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.66,0:19:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yakuza leaders who\Nonce supported Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.30,0:19:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,from the shadows are\Nall held at this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.68,0:19:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I will converse with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.26,0:19:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain that they'll\Njoin the cause for Kozuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.82,0:19:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Raizo, see that cell there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.78,0:19:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.44,0:20:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I have exchanged words with Kawamatsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.52,0:20:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He is the first one that I shall set free.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:20:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.30,0:20:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All I gotta do is rip this place apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.50,0:20:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll get a whole\Ncrap load of new friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.44,0:20:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Luffy, are you mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.88,0:20:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower your voice! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.84,0:20:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a plan to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.88,0:20:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, give me some drugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.48,0:20:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.48,0:20:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry, I'm tired, and\Nthere's no horse here to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.80,0:20:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Okiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.48,0:20:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Our sharkodile is exhausted too, but I'm\Nhappy to say we have already entered Udon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.56,0:20:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you, my sweet, sweet love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.40,0:20:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This might get messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.80,0:20:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.94,0:20:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.44,0:21:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, dear suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.18,0:21:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaking news!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.74,0:21:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's locked up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.12,0:21:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ushimitsu Koza, the elusive thief\Nterrorizing the flower capital, was caught!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.04,0:21:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Read about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.22,0:21:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a flyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.50,0:21:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Orochi, apologies for the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.82,0:21:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could have a moment of your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.72,0:21:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's concerning that troublesome thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.12,0:21:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We have apprehended him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.44,0:21:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.28,0:21:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I am in mourning for the love of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.60,0:21:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You will never understand the pain\Nof losing such a beautiful woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.80,0:21:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You do have my sympathy, Shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.16,0:21:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognize you're experiencing\Ngrief, but with all due respect, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.96,0:21:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiyoshiro had to take appropriate actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.36,0:21:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If we allowed her transgressions\Nto pass, you would have lost face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.16,0:21:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This situation would have undermined\Nyour authority and reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.96,0:22:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Orochi, I don't care about\Nsome miserable little robber.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.68,0:22:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's trivial to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.22,0:22:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no woman alive\Nwho could ever compete
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.72,0:22:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,with her immense beauty\Nand I was robbed of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.58,0:22:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see I want to be left to myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.46,0:22:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite your sorrow, it's nice you\Nhave emerged from your quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.08,0:22:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But I must strongly\Ninsist you listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.14,0:22:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The matter is pressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.46,0:22:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ushimitsu Koza was not\Nyour typical petty thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.36,0:22:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,On the surface, he's a crook with a hero\Ncomplex, bent on helping the lower class.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.68,0:22:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A menace to the rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.82,0:22:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's run amok on the flower\Ncapital for quite some time now,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.32,0:22:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but something greater is at play.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.30,0:22:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,As previously mentioned,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.46,0:23:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,he's currently being held at the\Nprisoner's quarters in Rasetsu Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.38,0:23:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But his identity is the interesting part.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.66,0:23:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.96,0:23:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.52,0:23:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How is the bastard still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.70,0:23:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,After all this time, is this a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.04,0:23:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Right under my nose, no less
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.06,0:23:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Course me clan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.86,0:23:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.36,0:23:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone but him?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.24,0:23:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.86,0:24:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Orochi, sir, we await your order.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.24,0:24:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you have us do with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.88,0:24:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really need to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.82,0:24:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The man must die!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.60,0:24:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Make an example of him\Nwith a public execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.36,0:24:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Put it on lightstraws everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.74,0:24:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Make certain that all can see!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.68,0:24:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.72,0:24:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.54,0:24:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoshiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.64,0:24:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know, today is the day that\NKomorosaki's public funeral will be held.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.50,0:24:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,With so many people in attendance,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.52,0:24:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,we expect that the event\Nmight become a bit unruly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.84,0:24:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I took it upon myself to prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.58,0:24:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes! Splendid!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.92,0:24:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your order, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.64,0:24:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I have an idea. Yes,\Nhave him personally accompany.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.84,0:24:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,kumasaki to the grave that wretched\Nlittle bastard will die today
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.94,0:25:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a two-for-one funeral some\Nof the brightest stars of the city
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.70,0:25:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Buried together. What a wicked twist of\Nfate. Excellent thinking, my lord. Now
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.52,0:25:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,bring me my ride i intend to witness
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.64,0:25:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,the entire tragedy go down that's not
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.60,0:25:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,funny you're in the booze early again\Naren't you kaido stop joking around
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.28,0:25:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,sorry it's true it's no\Nfair it can't be go check
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.18,0:25:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,your freaking light scroll\Nif you don't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.70,0:25:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It killed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.20,0:25:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.96,0:25:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.96,0:25:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.40,0:25:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn't hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.94,0:25:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows about the Oiran's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.84,0:25:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.68,0:25:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Expect him to be moody for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.50,0:25:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.96,0:26:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.38,0:26:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.86,0:26:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.38,0:26:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, why is it taking so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.36,0:26:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.84,0:26:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's been a change of plans now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.54,0:26:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.45,0:26:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if I say so!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.38,0:26:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get going already!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.78,0:26:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.18,0:26:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.09,0:26:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened to you\Ntwo between last night and today?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.80,0:26:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what I'm always like.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.74,0:26:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.56,0:26:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.70,0:26:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you think it's a bad time to\Ntell him all his soup went missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.20,0:26:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Overnight, too, are you\Ndumb? Who knows what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.20,0:26:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll do if he's hit with\Nmore bad news i agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.70,0:26:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of wondering how that much food\Njust uh walked away you did hear
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.40,0:26:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,me yes i advised Sir Luffy not to\Ngorge himself devouring the entire
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.44,0:26:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,pot was irresponsible of him given\Nhis Circumstance how does this
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.32,0:27:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,idiot keep surviving what is his\Nsecret let's start the sumo match!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.56,0:27:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't got time to deal\Nwith your nonsense today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.98,0:27:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something to tend to. Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.14,0:27:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me the flower capital right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.82,0:27:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the light scroll snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.74,0:27:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.18,0:27:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.26,0:27:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what's going on over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.08,0:27:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A video transponder snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.30,0:27:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.38,0:27:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.82,0:27:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be the flower capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.32,0:27:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They dared to steal our food and weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.26,0:27:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Show the Otamayama Thieves Brigade\Nwhat happens to those who cross us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.12,0:27:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of going in circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.84,0:28:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll shut your lying mouth with\Nmy trick mechanism so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.82,0:28:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't be long before the Atamayama\NThieves Brigade collapses.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.50,0:28:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire's spreading too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.96,0:28:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't put it out. It's massive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.54,0:28:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, Hold 'em screwed us over!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.26,0:28:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They're turned to Bekori Town!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.30,0:28:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.90,0:28:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Will Kaido's men come\Nafter us if we go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.56,0:28:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think I care?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.14,0:28:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.46,0:28:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kick all their asses!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.34,0:28:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.68,0:28:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, Ashura Doji\Nhas my deepest sympathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.70,0:28:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.61,0:28:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet this was for the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.00,0:29:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite its dire cost let's travel\Nto Bakada town I know not what
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.06,0:29:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,direction to take Now that our\Ninitial plans have been thwarted we
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.94,0:29:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,shall focus on one task ensuring\Nthat Ashita goes to battle with our
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.78,0:29:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,enemy Otherwise I fear our struggle\Nmay be lost before it even begins
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.34,0:29:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.82,0:29:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, who the heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.02,0:29:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.80,0:29:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Brook. What's up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.88,0:29:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.98,0:29:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Zoro! If I had ice, they would be\Nbugging out at the sight I'm seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.90,0:29:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I suppose I could\Nliterally drop my jaw to the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.84,0:29:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologies for the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.32,0:29:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see myself out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.22,0:29:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hey, it's not what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.46,0:29:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.60,0:30:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.08,0:30:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My mistake, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.10,0:30:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.01,0:30:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.12,0:30:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me for being so bold, but may\NI have a look at your panties, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.16,0:30:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.42,0:30:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. He's a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.66,0:30:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare for me a fine feast\Nor else I shall curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.18,0:30:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.22,0:30:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon instructed me to\Nstay here and scare off
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.90,0:30:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,people with that whole\Nhaunted house bed I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.70,0:30:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.61,0:30:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I wondered why so many people\Nleft offerings outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.42,0:30:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's incredible to think that you\Nwere the younger sister of Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.46,0:30:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful like the Oiran,\Na sight for sore eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.52,0:30:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had a bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.54,0:30:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Because she is an Oiran, silly!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.36,0:30:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you settle down\Nwith someone like her?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.82,0:31:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm quite envious, Oro.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.86,0:31:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We were only sleeping, you dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.22,0:31:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell him. Apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.26,0:31:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It was freezing and body heat\Nis a good source of warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.18,0:31:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,However, you're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.52,0:31:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Men are usually besotted by the\Nthought of sleeping next to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.72,0:31:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be thankful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.40,0:31:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So be honest, you loved it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.88,0:31:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, you are pretty forward, lady. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.76,0:31:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I hope that the rest of\Nour crew isn't too far behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.38,0:31:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The women set out to use\Nthe bathhouse yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.74,0:31:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but when I tried to find them, it\Nwas no use, as you might guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.10,0:31:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, the flower capital is in a\Nstate of chaos, if you didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.52,0:31:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,People are pouring into\Nthe city by the masses.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.96,0:31:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the funeral of Wano's\Nmost beautiful woman, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.08,0:31:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And they captured some thief who\Nsteals money and gives to the poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.00,0:31:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ushimitsu Koza is his name, and\Nhe seems as if he was a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.40,0:31:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you hear that news?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.98,0:31:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be. No, it's all true. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.76,0:31:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Read about it in this flyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.68,0:32:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be executed in the capital today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.14,0:32:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,His real identity has been\Na mystery until recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.86,0:32:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like he was quite\Nbeloved in Ebisu Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.04,0:32:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say Ebisu Town? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.66,0:32:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's more written.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.02,0:32:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If I remember, he goes by the\Nname something Yasuie, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.02,0:32:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Chono Yasuie?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.96,0:32:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the name?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.02,0:32:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.98,0:32:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Chaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.48,0:32:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.22,0:32:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back, Chaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.64,0:32:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving our lives yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.24,0:32:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall never forget your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.54,0:32:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.98,0:32:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't even protect her by yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.66,0:32:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.30,0:32:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you guys all running to?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.08,0:32:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I just got here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.46,0:32:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up! Everyone! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.76,0:33:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.92,0:33:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.46,0:33:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.37,0:33:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You come to escort me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.02,0:33:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That is mighty kind of you fellows.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.92,0:33:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.83,0:33:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.06,0:33:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He was caught?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.62,0:33:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.92,0:33:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's people who want you\Ndead out there, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.16,0:33:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.62,0:33:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs my help! Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.76,0:33:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to get a grip!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.14,0:33:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.90,0:33:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What has gotten into her? Taco!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.80,0:34:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going to kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.28,0:34:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.10,0:34:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to help him somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.44,0:34:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My daddy will die if I don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.70,0:34:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Taco...
